@razem_crisis
title: Razem calls an exit congress
subtitle: Its autonomous party, organisers and deputies can contest the election alone
new-page: true
view-if: razem_active = 1 and razem_escalation_stage = 2 and razem_demand_answered = 0

= Autonomy reaches its red line

**Razem** has reached **[+ razem_dissent +]/100 dissent**. Because it never
dissolved into Nowa Lewica, its private warnings carry a credible outside
option. It demands **[+ razem_demand +]** by month **[+ razem_demand_deadline +]**.

- @razem_compromise
- @razem_leave
- @razem_punish

@razem_compromise
title: Write enforceable outside-support milestones
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource and two budget promises. Razem remains autonomous but inside.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The guarantee lacks staff and a funded programme.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; razem_last_crisis_time = time; razem_demand_answered = 1; razem_escalation_stage = 0; razem_grievance_memory -= 22; razem_dissent -= 36; razem_cooperation += 10; budget_promises += 2; party_unity += 4; ko_relation -= 3; barons_dissent += 3; news_headline = "Enforceable milestones answer Razem's deadline"
go-to: return

@razem_leave
title: Accept free votes and a formally autonomous line
subtitle: Razem remains in the common club; an independent list is not yet inevitable.
