subtitle: A tiny caucus can still take a historic label, one or two seats and labour legitimacy
new-page: true
view-if: pps_active = 1 and pps_escalation_stage = 2 and pps_demand_answered = 0

= Small numbers, old symbols

**PPS** has only **[+ pps_strength : strength +]** of the internal balance, but
its name and social tradition give a break a cost larger than its raw delegate
count. It demands **[+ pps_demand +]** by month **[+ pps_demand_deadline +]**.

- @pps_compromise
- @pps_leave
- @pps_punish

@pps_compromise
title: Give PPS one programme seat and a social-floor guarantee
subtitle: Very little formal influence, but a durable place in the coalition.
